1
00:00:01,751 --> 00:00:02,919
What movie is it?

2
00:00:05,213 --> 00:00:06,506
You can look forward to it.

3
00:00:07,966 --> 00:00:09,968
It’s my favorite movie.

4
00:00:37,996 --> 00:00:38,955
What is it, unni?

5
00:00:39,873 --> 00:00:40,165
Huh?

6
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:41,958
What?

7
00:00:42,792 --> 00:00:45,253
You haven’t really been watching the movie this whole time.

8
00:00:47,672 --> 00:00:48,965
No, it’s not that.

9
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:51,176
It’s just…

10
00:00:51,468 --> 00:00:54,262
This movie’s more direct than I expected.

11
00:00:57,515 --> 00:00:59,976
I thought you’d be totally fine with stuff like this.

12
00:01:00,477 --> 00:01:02,979
That’s kinda surprising.

13
00:01:03,938 --> 00:01:05,273
M-me?

14
00:01:06,316 --> 00:01:08,276
You’re such a girl crush type.

15
00:01:09,152 --> 00:01:10,779
At work and at home.

16
00:01:15,825 --> 00:01:17,619
Exactly.

17
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,205
What do you mean?

18
00:01:22,749 --> 00:01:24,793
So you’re actually weak to scenes like this?

19
00:01:26,669 --> 00:01:28,254
Hey~

20
00:01:31,508 --> 00:01:33,009
Are you embarrassed?

21
00:01:35,762 --> 00:01:37,847
It’s not that I’m embarrassed.

22
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:40,600
It’s just distracting.

23
00:01:41,768 --> 00:01:43,436
What is?

24
00:01:46,147 --> 00:01:46,981
Because…

25
00:01:47,607 --> 00:01:49,484
you’re right next to me.

26
00:02:01,371 --> 00:02:02,664
Unni.

27
00:02:03,206 --> 00:02:04,415
Yeah?

28
00:02:37,949 --> 00:02:39,951
Wow, you’ve got a dirty mind.

29
00:02:40,702 --> 00:02:41,953
W-what are you talking about?

30
00:02:41,953 --> 00:02:42,996
That’s not true.

31
00:02:43,329 --> 00:02:44,956
Then why did you close your eyes?

32
00:02:46,416 --> 00:02:47,458
Something got in them…

33
00:03:01,347 --> 00:03:04,309
Do you want to have dinner with me tomorrow?

34
00:03:05,685 --> 00:03:06,519
Yeah.

35
00:03:07,770 --> 00:03:08,855
Sounds good.

36
00:03:11,608 --> 00:03:12,734
The movie’s over.

37
00:03:13,943 --> 00:03:15,737
I’ll clean this up.

38
00:03:33,963 --> 00:03:36,216
Gaeun: Let’s meet at Seongsu Station at 7! Don’t be late~!

39
00:03:36,216 --> 00:03:37,383
Yumi: Got it!

40
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:59,197
What’s up, Yumi? You look really happy today.

41
00:03:59,948 --> 00:04:00,990
Me?

42
00:04:02,408 --> 00:04:03,534
Not really.

43
00:04:04,744 --> 00:04:07,038
Come on, anyone can tell you’re in a good mood.

44
00:04:08,539 --> 00:04:10,541
What is it? Tell me too.

45
00:04:14,128 --> 00:04:17,882
Do you happen to know any good restaurants in Seongsu?

46
00:04:18,424 --> 00:04:21,010
Seongsu? I’ve got that place down.

47
00:04:21,469 --> 00:04:22,178
I’m basically a Seo—

48
00:04:22,345 --> 00:04:24,973
Oh, never mind. I’ll just look it up myself.

49
00:04:27,433 --> 00:04:28,935
I’m a Seongsu local though.

50
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:37,735
Yumi.

51
00:04:38,027 --> 00:04:39,696
Someone’s here to see you.

52
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,823
Yeah? Who is it?

53
00:04:51,457 --> 00:04:52,417
jimin

54
00:04:54,377 --> 00:04:56,212
What are you doing here?
